# The files a Blindspot release signs and attaches (docs/designs/signed-releases.md), one per line:
# the file name, a space, then how the release gets it.
#
#   committed   the file as committed in the reviewed commit
#   built       made by bash tools/gen.sh from the reviewed commit, at release
#
# Every root-level .sh, .ps1, .psm1, .bat, .cmd and .command file, and every file tools/gen.sh
# builds, is named here: a pull
# request that adds one adds its line too. bash tools/release.sh --check-list checks this, and
# tests/release.sh runs that check. A name is letters, digits, ".", "_" and "-".
gird-check.ps1 committed
gird-check.sh committed
gird-fleet.sh committed
gird-fleet.ps1 committed
gird-intune.ps1 committed
gird-report.ps1 committed
blindspot-fleet.sh built
blindspot-fleet.ps1 built
